{"4054750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tidewake", "steam_appid": 4054750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054750/extras/50a334207b9459bba6c450ab3bb21371.avif?t=1763878215\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054750/extras_big/50a334207b9459bba6c450ab3bb21371.webp?t=1763878215 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054750/extras/c0563d199b21388d6842aca89850c606.avif?t=1763878215\" width=780 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the uncharted seas of TideWake, an arcade sailing roguelite where chaotic cannon fire, relentless danger and mystic secrets define every voyage!<br><br>Command your ship as you cross the endless ocean, explore unseen locations and engage in brutal naval warfare! Salvage whatever loot you can find and upgrade your vessel from a wide variety of parts and pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize every aspect of your ship. Swap the hull, sails, wheel and cannons, each with their own unique stats that define your ship's feel. Discover ancient Trinkets to infuse your vessel with magical abilities to turn the tide of battle and defeat your foes. Balance repairs, cargo and resources to survive each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death resets your voyage, but with each defeat comes growth. Unlock new ship parts, Trinkets and events to encounter in the ocean with each run ended. Every run in Tidewake is new, from the ocean to the ship you travel it with.<br><br>Set Sail, fight mighty foes and claim your legacy! Wishlist Tidewake now and join the crew!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054750/extras/aeade16494a35e18389ca41a037dbc4e.avif?t=1763878215\" width=780 height=224 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054750/extras/c0563d199b21388d6842aca89850c606.avif?t=1763878215\" width=780 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the uncharted seas of TideWake, an arcade sailing roguelite where chaotic cannon fire, relentless danger and mystic secrets define every voyage!<br><br>Command your ship as you cross the endless ocean, explore unseen locations and engage in brutal naval warfare! Salvage whatever loot you can find and upgrade your vessel from a wide variety of parts and pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize every aspect of your ship. Swap the hull, sails, wheel and cannons, each with their own unique stats that define your ship's feel. Discover ancient Trinkets to infuse your vessel with magical abilities to turn the tide of battle and defeat your foes. Balance repairs, cargo and resources to survive each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death resets your voyage, but with each defeat comes growth. Unlock new ship parts, Trinkets and events to encounter in the ocean with each run ended. Every run in Tidewake is new, from the ocean to the ship you travel it with.<br><br>Set Sail, fight mighty foes and claim your legacy! Wishlist Tidewake now and join the crew!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4054750/extras/aeade16494a35e18389ca41a037dbc4e.avif?t=1763878215\" 